{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XTfGyga9dA5EDgFPJ7tKQY","type":"tool_result","content":"1054:- `game.audio.define(name, voice)`: add or replace a named sound: audio.define('zap', { wave: 'saw', freq: 1200, to: 200, dur: .2 })\n1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (default 0.03), step: a step of the music playing (it sounds on that step of the music clock, scheduled with the music: a rhythm game's calls and claps) }\n1075:- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\n1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\n1134:- `talk.voice = 'text'`: the sound effect each letter blips ('text'; null for silence)\n1543:- `new E.Rhythm(game, o = {}) → rhythm` †: new E.Rhythm(game, { song, chart, lanes, windows, life, lead, voice, on }): see the manual\n1570:- `rhythm.voice` †: the calls' sound\n\n2:my-3D2dge module ARCADE v0.85.2: the coin-op's frame: scores, high-score tables and initials, lives, credits, turns, cards, the attract mode\n17:- The attract mode, on the title: cab.attract(dt) -> 'title', then 'demo' once o.idle seconds (20) pass without input\n38: * ARCADE  scores, tables, initials, lives, credits, turns, cards and the attract mode\n45:   *  credits: null (free play) or the coins a game takes, idle: 20, demo: 30, scores: 6 (the attract mode's seconds),\n49:    this.game = game; this.id = o.id || 'game'; this.o = Object.assign({ lives: 3, extra: [], credits: null, idle: 20, demo: 30, scores: 6, hud: true, colors: COLS }, o);\n54:    /** mode: 'title' | 'play' | 'over'; demo: a demo is playing (no table); phase: the attract mode's, 'title' | 'demo' |\n59:    this._cards = []; this._idle = 0; this._t = 0; this._cont = null; this.wheel = null; this.hi = 0;\n61:  /** begin a game for 1 or 2 players (taking turns), o: { demo: true } for the attract mode's; spends the credits a\n114:  /** the attract mode, each step on the title: 'title', 'demo' (o.idle seconds without input; it lasts o.demo seconds or\n116:  attract(dt) {\n118:    if (I.anyPressed() || clicked(I)) { this._idle = 0; this.phase = 'title'; return 'title'; }\n119:    this._idle += dt;\n120:    const next = this.phase === 'title' ? (this._idle >= o.idle ? 'demo' : null) : this.phase === 'demo' ? (this._idle >= o.demo ? 'scores' : null) : this._idle >= o.scores ? 'title' : null;\n121:    if (next) { this.phase = next; this._idle = 0; }\n124:  /** the attract mode back to the title, its idle clock at zero (as any input does) */\n125:  wake() { this.phase = 'title'; this._idle = 0; }\n126:  /** the demo is over (a demo in a scene of its own: call it on the way back): the attract mode shows the scores */\n127:  endDemo() { this.phase = 'scores'; this._idle = 0; }\n203:  /** a table as a screen (the attract mode's, or after a game), its title at y: rank, name, score */\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174749__x8de669/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99d4115e-ac85-4844-bf9c-39009e8f9714","uuid":"9f0b316c-c544-4297-a64b-a89e977c01c7","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:51:22.903Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1054:- `game.audio.define(name, voice)`: add or replace a named sound: audio.define('zap', { wave: 'saw', freq: 1200, to: 200, dur: .2 })\n1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (default 0.03), step: a step of the music playing (it sounds on that step of the music clock, scheduled 