{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T1GzytkPZQ3aTMaNx7CgZ7","type":"tool_result","content":"# Every take of the CMU motion capture database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu; free for all uses), one a line. Written by\n# node tools/cmu.mjs survey, which converts each take into the readable format and measures it; edit only \"note\".\n# sec: length in seconds. category: what a game would use it for (from the words of its description). active: the\n\n# seconds where it moves (still stretches at either end left out). fit: the readable format's average and worst\n# percent of standing (under 60: crouching or lying; over 115: in the air or up on something). flags: inverted (upside\n# short (under a second), fps? (not on the site's list: 120 assumed), error. used: the CMU set's clips cut from it\n01_01\t1\t120\t22.9\tjump\t0.1-22.9\t19/96\t11.2\t84-133\t\t\t\tplayground - forward jumps, turn around\tclimb, swing, hang on playground equipment\n01_06\t1\t120\t42.8\tclimb\t0.0-42.8\t22/164\t19.0\t97-194\t\t\t\tplayground - climb, sit, dangle legs, descend\tclimb, swing, hang on playground equipment\n01_07\t1\t120\t40.3\tclimb\t0.0-40.3\t17/146\t18.2\t92-186\t\t\t\tplayground - climb, sit, dangle legs, jump down\tclimb, swing, hang on playground equipment\n01_08\t1\t120\t21.7\tclimb\t0.0-21.7\t20/220\t7.4\t88-179\tfloats\t\t\tplayground - climb, sit, dangle legs, rock back, lower self to ground\tclimb, swing, hang on\n01_09\t1\t120\t35.3\tclimb\t0.0-35.3\t22/225\t14.2\t44-186\tfloats\t\t\tplayground - climb, hang, hold self up with arms straight, swing, drop, sit, dangle legs, \n01_11\t1\t120\t38.8\tclimb\t0.0-38.8\t24/241\t18.1\t55-184\t\t\t\tplayground - climb, hang, lean over, jump down\tclimb, swing, hang on playground equipment\n01_12\t1\t120\t34.2\tclimb\t0.0-34.2\t30/222\t19.1\t78-180\tloose\t\t\tplayground - climb, pull up, dangle, sit, lower self to ground\tclimb, swing, hang on playgr\n01_13\t1\t120\t28.2\tclimb\t0.0-28.2\t23/176\t24.6\t39-191