{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y1Mao4sP59MHLXVbfjmcRF","type":"tool_result","content":"### 4.24 Audio (`12-audio.js`, `06-data-music.js`)\n\n**4.24.1 Music.** The engine's step sequencer plus the instrument patch (patch 4).\n\n**Instruments:**\n\n| Instrument | Built from |\n| --- | --- |\n| `steel` | partials 1, 2, 3, 4.2 at amps 1, .5, .35, .2; decay .5 s |\n| `marimba` | partials 1, 4, 9.9 at amps 1, .3, .05; decay .35 s |\n| `pluck` | saw through lowpass 1800; decay .25 s (ukulele and guitar) |\n| `bell` | partials 1, 2.76, 5.4, 8.9; decay 1.2 s |\n| `organ` | partials 1, 2, 3, 4; held |\n| `pad` | saw + detune 8 cents, lowpass 1200; held |\n\n...\n655:**Skill.** Each AI player has `skill = clamp(base × (0.8 + 0.05 × relevant stat), 0, 1)`.\n804:- roll moods, form NPC teams, place NPCs by schedule, rotate shop stock (2 items per shop);\n909:**Shops**, all on the Promenade. Each has fixed core stock plus 2 items that rotate daily (seeded) and carry a NEW\n927:**Wardrobe** (the Villa closet, and the changing hut at the Beach and Pool): the suits and accessories you own; ✕\n984:| Promenade | three shop doors, the changing hut |\n986:| Night | the casino entrance |\n1092:| right stick / right-drag | orbit at any angle (`game.rotateView`) |\n1575:  icons, weather icons, lock, NEW badge, camera.\n1718:**5.2.3 Gifts (25).** Each shop has 2 daily deals at −25%, picked by the `world` rng; some items arrive later. Icons\n1792:| **Sunset Courts** | Morning, Afternoon (final and party override) | the 44×28 court map (§4.3) | Court A, bleachers, Tiki Tok Bar (Kai), umbrellas and lo\n1793:| **Lagoon Pool** | Morning, Afternoon | 30×22 | a free-form pool, the Pool Hop deck and 32 pads, cabana bar, loungers, flamingo float, palms, tiki torches\n1796:| **Casino Fortuna** | Night | 30×20 | cashier, 6 slots, blackjack (Pepper), roulette (Kai), VIP lounge (Sonny), prize counter, chandeliers, neon | 3 at sl\n1801:| NPC | Morning | Afternoo