{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2kvoqDVUmCPLEytM6W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FGK6Tf4DFCyTywXY8Wn2Z8","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174749__x8de669/work/PLAN.md","offset":653,"limit":10},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1802,"cache_read_input_tokens":527459,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1802},"output_tokens":108,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99d4115e-ac85-4844-bf9c-39009e8f9714","uuid":"7bb2193f-062d-40e5-80a8-29addda93a81","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:36:44.908Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh2kvZSDAwykoN1L8Chd","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01FGK6Tf4DFCyTywXY8Wn2Z8":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174749__x8de669/work/PLAN.md","offset":653,"limit":10}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FGK6Tf4DFCyTywXY8Wn2Z8","type":"tool_result","content":"653\t### 4.7 AI (`23-ai.js`)\n654\t\n655\t**Skill.** Each AI player has `skill = clamp(base × (0.8 + 0.05 × relevant stat), 0, 1)`.\n656\t\n657\t- `base` is the day's value (§5.6) plus the difficulty offset (Easy −.2, Normal 0, Hard +.12, Pro +.22).\n658\t- An AI partner of the player also gets × chemistry: `(1 − T.chemistry/2) + T.chemistry × affinity/100` (default\n659\t  `T.chemistry` .3, which gives .85–1.15).\n660\t\n661\t**Reaction.** She starts toward P* `T.aiReaction × (1.2 − skill)` s after a launch, and moves at speed × `T.aiSpeedMul`.\n662\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99d4115e-ac85-4844-bf9c-39009e8f9714","uuid":"2166f30b-e843-4568-a5e0-01ea6cca2cfa","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:36:44.914Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174749__x8de669/work/PLAN.md","content":"### 4.7 AI (`23-ai.js`)\n\n**Skill.** Each AI player has `skill = clamp(base × (0.8 + 0.05 × relevant stat), 0, 1)`.\n\n- `base` is the day's value (§5.6) plus the difficulty offset (Easy −.2, Normal 0, Hard +.12, Pro +.22).\n- An AI partner of the player also gets × chemistry: `(1 − T.chemistry/2) + T.chemistry × affinity/100` (default\n  `T.chemistry` .3, which gives .85–1.15).\n\n**Reaction.** She starts toward P* `T.aiReaction × (1.2 − skill)` s after a launch, and moves at speed × `T.aiSpeedMul`.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":653,"totalLines":2180}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FGK6Tf4DFCyTywXY8Wn2Z8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
