{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019pESUwgzhQYyogYXpNDxXX","type":"tool_result","content":"1058\t**Blackjack.**\n1059\t\n1060\t- 6-deck shoe, reshuffled at 75%. The dealer stands on soft 17 (`T.dealerHitsSoft17` toggles it). Blackjack pays 3:2.\n1061\t  Double on any first two cards. Split once; split aces get one card each. No insurance, no surrender.\n1062\t- Bets of 1, 5, 10 or 25 chips (a stepper).\n1063\t- Controls: ✕/H hit, □/S stand, △/D double, R1/P split (only when legal), ○ leave between hands. Every button is also\n1064\t  clickable on screen.\n1065\t- Cards are pixel sprites (rank glyphs and suit sprites ♠ ♥ ♦ ♣ made with `E.sprite`), dealt with tweens and flipped.\n1066\t  Pepper has deadpan lines for a blackjack and a bust.\n1067\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99d4115e-ac85-4844-bf9c-39009e8f9714","uuid":"0093b712-1d70-44b8-ba9b-e8d3a79d68a3","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:37:05.345Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174749__x8de669/work/PLAN.md","content":"**Blackjack.**\n\n- 6-deck shoe, reshuffled at 75%. The dealer stands on soft 17 (`T.dealerHitsSoft17` toggles it). Blackjack pays 3:2.\n  Double on any first two cards. Split once; split aces get one card each. No insurance, no surrender.\n- Bets of 1, 5, 10 or 25 chips (a stepper).\n- Controls: ✕/H hit, □/S stand, △/D double, R1/P split (only when legal), ○ leave between hands. Every button is also\n  clickable on screen.\n- Cards are pixel sprites (rank glyphs and suit sprites ♠ ♥ ♦ ♣ made with `E.sprite`), dealt with tweens and flipped.\n  Pepper has deadpan lines for a blackjack and a bust.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1058,"totalLines":2186}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019pESUwgzhQYyogYXpNDxXX","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
